stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> CheckInFlight: try_publish()
    CheckInFlight --> Published: in_flight < max_in_flight
    CheckInFlight --> DropLatest: policy=drop_latest AND full
    CheckInFlight --> StallUI: policy=stall_ui AND full
    CheckInFlight --> TripleBuffer: policy=triple_buffer AND slots available
    Published --> Idle: release() on render
    DropLatest --> Idle: dropped_count++
    StallUI --> Idle: return false to UI
    TripleBuffer --> Published: up to 2 in flight / 3 slots
